### Added — NTFF boxes on uniform multi-device runs (#1402)

`sim.run(devices=[...])` now returns the NTFF box and its complete surface
DFT record, including Kahan compensation, for far-field and antenna-gain
post-processing. Each slab accumulates its owned face cells using the
one-device stencil and exchanges the Hx neighbour required at x seams.
Graded meshes and distributed forward NTFF remain unsupported.
